{"id":"2e83eb34fc230e69","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-cor-ordinal-arith.md","title":"Ordinal Arithmetic","display":"cor-ordinal-arith — Ordinal Arithmetic","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-ordinal-arith","aliases":["58-cor-ordinal-arith"],"display":"cor-ordinal-arith — Ordinal Arithmetic","depends_on":["[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-ordinal-arithmetic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-ordinal-arith"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-ordinal-arith</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-ordinal-arith — Ordinal Arithmetic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d74493bfaf9bf48a\" href=\"?note=d74493bfaf9bf48a\" title=\"58-df-ordinal-arithmetic\">58-df-ordinal-arithmetic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in V\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\">\\(+\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot\">\\(\\cdot\\)</span> are ordinal addition and multiplication from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d74493bfaf9bf48a\" href=\"?note=d74493bfaf9bf48a\" title=\"58-df-ordinal-arithmetic\">58-df-ordinal-arithmetic</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}arith} \\vdash \\forall\\alpha\\;\\forall\\beta\\;\\forall\\gamma\\;\\Bigl((\\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\gamma))\\to\\alpha\\cdot(\\beta+\\gamma)=\\alpha\\cdot\\beta+\\alpha\\cdot\\gamma\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}arith} \\vdash \\forall\\alpha\\;\\forall\\beta\\;\\forall\\gamma\\;\\Bigl((\\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\gamma))\\to\\alpha\\cdot(\\beta+\\gamma)=\\alpha\\cdot\\beta+\\alpha\\cdot\\gamma\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The dependency now points to transfinite ordinal arithmetic; the former target defined integer gcd and lcm.</li>\n<li>Left multiplication by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> distributes over a sum in the right argument.</li>\n<li>Right distributivity can fail for ordinal multiplication.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"d74493bfaf9bf48a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-ordinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"d74493bfaf9bf48a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$+$ and $\\cdot$ are ordinal addition and multiplication from [[58-df-ordinal-arithmetic]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"+","display":false},{"tex":"\\cdot","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}arith} \\vdash \\forall\\alpha\\;\\forall\\beta\\;\\forall\\gamma\\;\\Bigl((\\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\operatorname{Ordinal}(\\gamma))\\to\\alpha\\cdot(\\beta+\\gamma)=\\alpha\\cdot\\beta+\\alpha\\cdot\\gamma\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false}],"bytes":1069,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-81","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-cor-ordinal-arith.md|58-cor-ordinal-arith]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["5582a281f15a33c2","d74493bfaf9bf48a"]}